---
// Work With Me section - three engagement models
---

<section id="services" class="services">
  <div class="services-container">
    <h2>How to Work With Me</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">Three ways we can collaborate</p>
    
    <div class="services-grid">
      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="service-icon">💼</div>
        <h3>Freelance & Consulting</h3>
        <p class="service-rate">$40–$70/hour</p>
        <p class="rate-note">Rates may vary for clients in the Egyptian market, project scope, and engagement model.</p>
        <p>
          AI engineering, ML system architecture, production AI consulting, LLM applications,
          MLOps infrastructure, backend development, and technical leadership.
        </p>
        <ul class="service-highlights">
          <li>30-minute project discussion to scope work</li>
          <li>Flexible hourly or project-based rates</li>
          <li>Part-time or full-project engagements</li>
          <li>Architecture & code review support</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="service-icon">🎓</div>
        <h3>CV & Career Guidance</h3>
        <p class="service-rate">Free / Volunteer</p>
        <p>
          For students, graduates, and early-career professionals entering AI, data science, 
          or software engineering.
        </p>
        <ul class="service-highlights">
          <li>Resume & LinkedIn review & feedback</li>
          <li>Positioning & job-search strategy</li>
          <li>Async email/LinkedIn feedback</li>
          <li>Optional 15-min follow-up call</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="service-icon">🎤</div>
        <h3>Technical Speaking</h3>
        <p class="service-rate">Flexible (Paid or Volunteer)</p>
        <p>
          Talks, workshops, and keynotes for universities, conferences, technical communities, 
          and company events.
        </p>
        <ul class="service-highlights">
          <li>Topics: Production AI, LLMs, MLOps, AI careers</li>
          <li>Online or in-person (prefer: Cairo area)</li>
          <li>30–60 minute sessions</li>
          <li>Contact to discuss topics & logistics</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="availability-note">
      <p>
        <strong>Current Status:</strong> I'm actively exploring my next full-time opportunity 
        while taking on selected freelance work. Any engagement is subject to availability 
        and will be discontinued if required by a full-time employment agreement.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .services {
    padding: 5rem 1.5rem;
    background: #f8f9fa;
  }

  .services-container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .services h2 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-align: center;
    margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
    color: #0f0f1e;
  }

  .section-intro {
    text-align: center;
    color: #666;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    margin: 0 0 3rem 0;
  }

  .services-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .service-card {
    background: white;
    padding: 2rem;
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .service-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
  }

  .service-icon {
    font-size: 3rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .service-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
    color: #0f0f1e;
  }

  .service-rate {
    color: #64d5ff;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    margin: 0 0 0.4rem 0;
  }

  .rate-note {
    color: #999;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-style: italic;
    margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
  }

  .service-card p {
    color: #666;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem 0;
  }

  .service-highlights {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .service-highlights li {
    padding: 0.5rem 0;
    color: #666;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
  }

  .service-highlights li:before {
    content: "→";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: #64d5ff;
    font-weight: bold;
  }

  .availability-note {
    background: white;
    padding: 2rem;
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    border-left: 4px solid #64d5ff;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .availability-note p {
    color: #666;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .services {
      padding: 3rem 1.5rem;
    }

    .services h2 {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }

    .services-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
